.TH HSH 1 "31/08/2026" "1.0" "Simple Shell Manual"
.SH NAME
hsh \- simple UNIX command line interpreter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hsh
.SH DESCRIPTION
hsh is a simple command line interpreter for Linux, providing functionality similar to cmd on Windows or bash on Linux. It reads commands from standard input and executes them.
.PP
hsh supports:
.IP \(bu
Executing commands directly using their full path, for example
.B /bin/ls
.IP \(bu
Searching the PATH environment variable to locate commands automatically, for example
.B ls
.IP \(bu
Dynamically retrieving the PATH from the system environment at runtime, ensuring compatibility across different systems
.IP \(bu
The built-in command
.B exit
.IP \(bu
The built-in command
.B env
